Maintainer: Firstname1 Lastname1 <fl1@cornell.edu>
Description: Tools for analyzing simulated bike-share dock snapshots. Given
    a time-series of bike locations, the package computes dock availability
    probabilities, pairwise dock distances, and recommends optimal pickup and
    drop-off docks for a rider's trip. Designed for the Cornell Six Sigma
    Hackathon Urban Systems prompt (Big Red Crew, Oct 2026).
